    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nA fantastic opportunity to acquire a detached four-bedroom bungalow with an attached garage, set in a lovely rural location and offering huge potential to create a beautiful family home.\n\nThe property is in need of modernisation but provides spacious accommodation and an excellent opportunity for the new owners to put their own stamp on it and transform it into a wonderful home. This property may be eligible for the Vacant Home Grant.\n\nSituated in a peaceful and picturesque setting with stunning countryside views, the property is located less than 2km from Shanballymore village, making it ideally positioned for those seeking a rural lifestyle while remaining close to local amenities.The village offers a range of amenities including a local pub, GAA facilities, school and church all within easy reach.\n\nLocated less than 6km from Killdorrery, a 15 minute drive from both Mallow and Mitchelstown town."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.15m x 1.06m\nCarpet\n\nLiving Room - 3.45m x 4.73m\nCarpet, Timber Fireplace with stove insert, Cornicing to ceiling\n\nKitchen - 3.84m x 3.25m\nLino flooring, Fully fitted kitchen, Range, Door to side\n\nUtility Room - 1.36m x 2.93m\nLino flooring, Fitted units with sink, Plumbed for washing machine.\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.28m x 2.81m\nCarpet\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.31m x 3m\nCarpet\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.94m x 3.65m\nLino flooring\n\nBedroom 4 - 2.87m x 1.83\nCarpet flooring\n\nBathroom - 1.84m x 1.64m\nLino flooring, Electric shower, Whb and Toilet\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
